WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Ask. Ask questions, think through an idea, or assign work from one clean conversation.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Conversations. Return to saved conversations and work through questions about your private records.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Assigned work. Follow assigned tasks, inspect completed steps, and review the result.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Now. See your daily briefing, overlapping appointments, and the next thing that needs you.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Promises. Track promises in both directions and review a suggested reply before sending.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Calendar. See your schedule in day, week, or month views and spot conflicts.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Money. Bring recorded transactions, spending categories, cash flow, and invoices into view.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Health. Keep activity, measurements, lab records, and weekly meal and exercise plans together.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Groceries. Review ingredients, quantities, estimated costs, and what you already have.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Progress. Look back at completed work, daily activity, and weekly reports.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Imports. Choose a statement, invoice, or lab report. Review extracted records before saving.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Booking. Set meeting availability and keep upcoming bookings in view.
